{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52558","headline":"其六 · 陈元光","name":"其六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戍楼西北请泉山，十载干戈暑又寒。\n红锦飘来枫树醉，黄金废尽菊花残。\n故园橙橘小春闹，圣席圆汤冬至闲。\n剑戟百磨岩石裂，骅骝羣饮泽泉乾。\n雪花散杂梅花媚，白水前爲墨水餐。\n河腹冰坚防虏骑，边陲雨涷弊征鞍。\n水窗向北因风寒，密垒开东得月看。\n迭起寒鸡犹未唱，铜壶先滴五更阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}